ndreds of folk-song arrangements and Lieder.", "extract_html": "<p><b>Johannes Brahms</b> was a German composer, pianist, and conductor of the mid-Romantic period. His music features expressive counterpoint, freer dissonance, rhythmic vitality, and traditional forms. His works include four symphonies, four concertos, a Requiem, much chamber music, and hundreds of folk-song arrangements and <span><i lang=\"de\">Lieder</i></span>.</p>"}